412
00:23:06,481 --> 00:23:07,001
Ashito!

413
00:23:07,841 --> 00:23:08,281
Muto!

414
00:23:08,561 --> 00:23:10,161
You're supposed to be marking him!

415
00:23:10,321 --> 00:23:11,121
What are you doing?

416
00:23:11,221 --> 00:23:12,381
Don't let him break free!

417
00:23:16,961 --> 00:23:17,441
Ashito!

418
00:23:18,021 --> 00:23:18,541
Tachibana!

419
00:23:19,221 --> 00:23:20,401
They're both in a good position

420
00:23:20,401 --> 00:23:21,081
to take a shot.

421
00:23:21,921 --> 00:23:23,161
So who do I pass it to?

422
00:23:23,981 --> 00:23:24,281
Who?

423
00:23:26,821 --> 00:23:27,341
Ashito!

424
00:23:27,761 --> 00:23:28,781
I knew it'd be you!

425
00:23:33,881 --> 00:23:35,421
What the heck is happening?

426
00:23:35,841 --> 00:23:36,841
What's he trying to do?

427
00:23:37,001 --> 00:23:44,861
The right-side fullback?

428
00:23:45,161 --> 00:23:45,821
No way!

429
00:23:48,401 --> 00:23:49,981
You're not gonna shoot!

430
00:23:55,221 --> 00:23:56,061
That's it.

431
00:23:56,321 --> 00:23:56,961
He's through.

432
00:23:57,961 --> 00:23:58,341
Yeah!

433
00:23:58,341 --> 00:24:12,121
Next time on Aowashi,

434
00:24:12,121 --> 00:24:13,821
From Now!

435
00:24:23,821 --> 00:24:26,181
Next time on Aowashi,

436
00:24:26,621 --> 00:24:27,721
From Now!

437
00:24:27,721 --> 00:24:28,441
Go to now!

438
00:24:28,561 --> 00:24:28,681
Go!

439
00:24:30,861 --> 00:24:31,701
Next time on Aowashi

440
00:24:32,321 --> 00:24:33,221
Go!

441
00:24:33,681 --> 00:24:34,181
This time on Aowashi,

442
